{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"sticks_bundle","model_identifier":"sticks_bundle","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## sticks_bundle\n\nCarried load, wood.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x 0.1..4.9, y -0.2..4.0, z -20.0..20.0 (size 4.8 x 4.2 x 40.0 u = 14 x 12 x 112 cm).\nBundle of straight hazel sticks (six sticks ~1.1 m long) tied with cord at two points. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 0.2.\n"},"description":"## sticks_bundle\n\nCarried load, wood.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x 0.1..4.9, y -0.2..4.0, z -20.0..20.0 (size 4.8 x 4.2 x 40.0 u = 14 x 12 x 112 cm).\nBundle of straight hazel sticks (six sticks ~1.1 m long) tied with cord at two points. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 0.2.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"stick_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.3999999999999999,0.0,-19.0],"to":[1.6,1.2,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[37,61,38.2,62.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,51,37.0,52.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[39,61,40.2,62.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,53,37.0,54.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12,0,13.2,37.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[